Still 1.2.0. Three fixes from your testing.

Your music is no longer quietened while pocket mode listens. Ducking does not begin when this app plays something — Apple's wording is that it begins when the session is activated — so a session held open to hear taps lowered your music all ride. A setting puts it back, and says plainly that it quietens the whole ride, not only while somebody talks.

And a dropped connection no longer leaves the screen locked with the slider gone.
